'''Granite Flask''' is a [[utility flask]] base type.

==Modifiers==
{{Main|List of modifiers for utility flasks}}

The effect of Granite Flask can be stacked with the effect from {{il|Basalt Flask}}.
{{Item unique versions}}

{{Item acquisition}}

{{Item skin list}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.00 seconds instead.

